    "issues": [
      "The spell should not be encoded as a player choice between two modes. Replace the root `choose` with a single targeted damage effect that selects one enemy follower, then uses an `if` checking that both Bunny & Baron, Specter Duo and Val, Trusty Getaway Car are on your field to deal 6 damage and 2 damage to that follower's leader; otherwise deal 4 damage to the selected follower.",
